**1. Introduction**  
This document outlines the technical specifications for the integration of the MedTech SmartMonitor 3000, a patient monitoring system, into the St. Joseph's Hospital network in San Francisco, CA. The system will enhance patient care through real-time data analytics and facilitate clinical trials under the oversight of the FDA and the Clinical Trials Regulatory Authority (CTRA).

**2. Requir

